<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-07T02:06:16.031Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 02:06:16 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Joseph Kabila now heads a rebel coalition that includes M23, which has seized positions in Rugezi after a week of fighting with Congolese government forces. The United States has sanctioned Rwanda's defence ministry and its military bank Zigama and is moving to remove Rwanda and South Africa from the AGOA duty-free trade programme. An Ebola outbreak in eastern DR Congo has killed more than 5,300 people and a UK doctor contracted the disease while responding to the crisis. The Allied Democratic Forces have returned to Lubero, rescued 29 hostages and continue to spread fear, while IS-linked militants killed at least 33 civilians in a village attack. 1,158 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/world/europe/europe-migrants-rwanda.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBrckd2V1JMLWpNY2NBd0ZjaV9PRTlvU2JvM3ZrNUZqTDB1cXhKM2EwZWVKN2E2eElEdGRtSWxFTk9fZzRYVE1zSW5JdjdPVWdaTURWMjVXQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Le Monde.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQTEc3VWRicmFISXlSQWxkVWhYYWM1ZTBfNk9HMVpNaFV3dlpveDFfRWNFWHBTT1Z5TW1pUF8tLU9OUkNaNmFnMUZ0ajFQaEZjTUpsY21KemJzRlBhTjdGWFlSbEU4QURwMEFFMUVkNlZrM2NtOVNZV0FRV0xlWm4zeXFqbXZoZENiRk9ITlVzNm_SAZYBQVVfeXFMT3QzSDNZNGhnSU5WVG1pdDc4OU42YXNoWGhRYm9Mc1NlcG5ENkttMlBCMnE3UURaaGxqREhxai1lMk5XbVlWRUZYM2MtdS1lUDhTSXJLVW9lUEpnYTZWd0RUUWZDODc0TEw4NEtheE9vMGx1SmNBVG1TTlpLaFctUzBKQ25wemY0NnlmdFNHb2JKWjQ3eVVn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Qazinform&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/article